     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE "6 3 9 8" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK-DONE

     MOVE "acceptance US14 crossbow charge time is floor(20 x (1.25 - 0.25 per Quick Charge level)): 25, 20, 15, 10 ticks" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I1
     CALL "TOOL-CROSSBOW-CHARGE" USING WS-I1 WS-O1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE 1 TO WS-I1
     CALL "TOOL-CROSSBOW-CHARGE" USING WS-I1 WS-O1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE 2 TO WS-I1
     CALL "TOOL-CROSSBOW-CHARGE" USING WS-I1 WS-O1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
